#!/bin/sh
cat <<'EOF'
\033[1;36mDrakonis Help Center\033[0m

Welcome to Drakonis Linux, a Debian XFCE environment for authorized defensive analysis.

Safety
  mll-network-isolation enable    block non-loopback output
  mll-network-isolation status    inspect isolation rules
  mll-help                        read the legal-use guide

Desktop utilities
  drakonis-security-center        review local security state
  drakonis-network-tools          inspect local interfaces and sockets
  drakonis-themes-manager         select the installed visual theme
  drakonis-power-session           lock or end the session safely

Use only systems, accounts, traffic, and data that you own or are explicitly authorized to assess.
Press Enter to close...
EOF
read _
